error[T-Equal]: `I.Item` must be the same type as `UInt8`, and here they are `UInt32` and `UInt8`
  --> tests/where_equality/two_applied_trait_operations_report_their_own_equality.lin:21:13
   |
7  | impl[I: Iterator] Measure[UInt8] for Wrap[I] where I.Item == UInt8 {
   |                                                    --------------- required by this `where` clause
21 |     let a = wrap.count_as(UInt8(1))
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ both sides of the equality must settle to one type
   |
   = note: so the `Measure[UInt8]` implementation does not serve `Wrap[Range[UInt32]]`
